   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Let \\( u = x \\) and \\( dv = \\cos{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\, dx \\), so \\( du = dx \\) and \\( v = \\frac{\\sin{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2} \\).",
